Raven archive 05 -- route 350.
The river has begun to freeze as WINTER approaches.
Riders carried news of winter to the nearest keep.
The western road remained open throughout the night.
Rumors spread after the chamber around the THRONE was closed.
The royal seal was discovered beneath the throne.
The watch requested warmer cloaks because of Winter.
A sealed decree was placed beside the Throne.
Two riders returned safely from Bran.
A new banner was displayed behind the Throne.
The northern farms are preparing carefully for Winter.
Merchants raised their prices after hearing of Winter.
A sailor swore that the Dragon flew toward the east.
A white raven was released to announce winter.
The guards found marks that may belong to a DRAGON.
The messenger changed horses at the final checkpoint.
The scouts believe WINTER will reach the valley soon.
A maester recorded signs of winter beyond the ridge.
Rain damaged one corner of the document.
